  "post_content": "<p>Pili Maza G&oacute;rriz ha ganado un a&ntilde;o de peluquer&iacute;a gratis en Lluna Estilistes, tras el sorteo realizado con motivo de la Feria Medieval de Onda, en el que Fina Hernando Domingo ha conseguido un lote de productos solares.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/08/IMG_1499.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El sorteo se ha realizado a mediod&iacute;a de este lunes en el local de Lluna Estilistes, en la avenida Catalu&ntilde;a, 36, de Onda.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigllunaestilistesfiramedieval/img_1489.jpg\" alt=\"img_1489\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigllunaestilistesfiramedieval/img_1490.jpg\" alt=\"img_1490\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigllunaestilistesfiramedieval/img_1491.jpg\" alt=\"img_1491\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigllunaestilistesfiramedieval/img_1492.jpg\" alt=\"img_1492\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigllunaestilistesfiramedieval/img_1493.jpg\" alt=\"img_1493\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigllunaestilistesfiramedieval/img_1494.jpg\" alt=\"img_1494\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigllunaestilistesfiramedieval/img_1495.jpg\" alt=\"img_1495\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigllunaestilistesfiramedieval/img_1496.jpg\" alt=\"img_1496\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img